  "settings.about.project.p1.middle": {"chs":"协议发布（见页面底部），代码托管于GitHub，欢迎各位用户添加Star和参与贡献：","cht":"以本協議發布（見頁面底部），程式碼託管於GitHub，歡迎各位使用者Star並參與貢獻：","en-us":"license, the source codes are available on GitHub. Feel free to star the repository and contribute: ","en-uk":"license, the source codes are available on GitHub. Feel free to star the repository and contribute: ","jpn":"本プロジェクトは本ライセンスで公開され、ソースコードは GitHub で管理しています。Star や貢献を歓迎します："},
  "settings.about.project.p1.prefix": {"chs":"此项目基于","cht":"本專案基於","en-us":"This project is released based on the","en-uk":"This project is released based on the","jpn":"本プロジェクトは次のライセンスに基づいて公開されています："},
  "settings.about.project.p2.text": {"chs":"本地化状态：简中、繁中、美英、英英、日语文本已完成。简中与美英为人工编写；繁中与英英由语言模型对照简中及美英生成，并经人工审查与改进；日语完全由语言模型生成，尚未审查，正在寻求贡献者协助校对，如你有兴趣，请在此项目的GitHub仓库中提出Issue。","cht":"本地化狀態：簡中、繁中、美英、英英、日語文本已完成。簡中與美英為人工編寫；繁中與英英由語言模型對照簡中及美英生成，並經人工審查與改進；日語完全由語言模型生成，尚未審查，正在尋求貢獻者協助校對。如你有興趣，請在此專案的GitHub倉庫提出Issue。","en-us":"Localization status: Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, EN-US, EN-UK, and Japanese are complete. Simplified Chinese and EN-US were written manually. Traditional Chinese and EN-UK were generated by a language model based on Simplified Chinese and EN-US, then reviewed and improved manually. Japanese was generated entirely by a language model and has not been reviewed yet. We're looking for contributors to help proofread; if you're interested, please open an issue in the project's GitHub repository.","en-uk":"Localization status: Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, EN-US, EN-UK, and Japanese are complete. Simplified Chinese and EN-US were written manually. Traditional Chinese and EN-UK were generated by a language model based on Simplified Chinese and EN-US, then reviewed and improved manually. Japanese was generated entirely by a language model and has not been reviewed yet. We're looking for contributors to help proofread; if you're interested, please open an issue in the project's GitHub repository.","jpn":"ローカライズ状況：簡体中文／繁体中文／EN-US／EN-UK／日本語は完了しています。簡体中文と EN-US は手動で作成しました。繁体中文と EN-UK は言語モデルが簡体中文と EN-US を参照して生成し、手動で審査・改善しています。日本語は言語モデルのみで生成され、未校正です。現在、校正に協力してくれる貢献者を募集しています。興味があれば、本プロジェクトの GitHub リポジトリで Issue を立ててください。"},
